      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Perhaps this is not a bug, after all? Or the design for expectation of privacy hasn't been well defined.\n\n1. Create a Public visibility avatar\n\n2. Have someone add the Public avatar to favorites (and change into it)\n\n3. Change the avatar visibility to now be Private\n\n4. Have the other person check their Favorite avatars in-app again, they are able to see the name and photo of that avatar with a \"?\" performance rank, but no other details of that avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
