  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When accessing a private avatar's URL, the webpage frontend displays the error: \"Error: Avatar Not Found.\"\n\nHowever, if the F12 Developer Tools are opened and the Network panel is inspected, information that should not be visible—such as the cover image URL, name, and description—can still be viewed. This data could potentially be exploited by third parties for illicit information gathering.",
